{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38921","headline":"乱後逢李昭象叙别 · 杜荀鹤","name":"乱後逢李昭象叙别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李生李生何所之，家山窣云胡不归。\n兵戈到处弄性命，礼乐向人生是非。\n却与野猿同橡坞，还将溪鸟共渔矶。\n也知不是男儿事，争奈时情贱布衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}